{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t\tManagement\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Static IP in /etc/network/interfaces, DNS in resolv.conf, networking restart, and ifconfig.","label":"Network","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/memory","label":"Memory","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/memory"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/permissions","label":"Permissions","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/permissions"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Static IP<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConfigure a static address in <code class='inline'>\/etc\/network\/interfaces<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>auto lo eth0\niface lo inet loopback\niface eth0 inet &lt;static|dynamic&gt;\n        address 192.168.1.101\n        netmask 255.255.255.0\n        gateway 192.168.1.1<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>DNS<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDNS servers are listed in <code class='inline'>\/etc\/resolv.conf<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Restart<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/etc\/init.d\/networking restart<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: restarting networking is an admin action.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Info<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ifconfig<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/network\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/network\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/memory' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/memory' data-title='Memory' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Memory<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/permissions' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/permissions' data-title='Permissions' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Permissions<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/reso